      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_09",
      "hash64": "A44ABEE088F7557F",
      "text": "O sea, que te voy a devolver el favor dándote\\nalgo que te vendrá de perlas.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_10",
      "hash64": "A44E4BE088FA7AED",
      "text": "Y otra perla para ti, pero esta vez de sabiduría:\\nla felicidad funciona parecido al agua, ¿sabes?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_11",
      "hash64": "A44E4AE088FA793A",
      "text": "Se puede convertir en un charco, una laguna\\no un lago: ¡todo depende de tu mentalidad![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
